    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cal\u00edgine</strong> is a classic Point-and-Click graphic adventure that takes you to the unsettling mountain village of <i>Risco de la Colina</i>. A handcrafted narrative experience.<br>As a detective, your mission is to investigate the disappearance of a colleague\u2014a case that initially seems routine but soon reveals dark secrets tied to the village's enigmatic past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.poster.avif?t=1753763083\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.webm?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.mp4?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the fascinating universe of <strong>Par\u00e1metro Zero</strong>, a fiction born from an extensive role-playing campaign that has brought to life a world filled with stories, complex characters, and mysteries waiting to be uncovered. As you explore the village, you will solve challenging puzzles and uncover fragments of <i>Risco de la Colina</i>'s hidden history, where echoes of ancient secrets still linger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.poster.avif?t=1753763083\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.webm?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.mp4?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its somber atmosphere, intriguing characters, and carefully crafted setting, <strong>Cal\u00edgine</strong> delivers an experience that blends the nostalgia of traditional graphic adventures with a mature and captivating narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to uncover the secrets hidden in <i>Risco de la Colina</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.poster.avif?t=1753763083\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.webm?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.mp4?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cal\u00edgine</strong> is a classic Point-and-Click graphic adventure that takes you to the unsettling mountain village of <i>Risco de la Colina</i>. A handcrafted narrative experience.<br>As a detective, your mission is to investigate the disappearance of a colleague\u2014a case that initially seems routine but soon reveals dark secrets tied to the village's enigmatic past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.poster.avif?t=1753763083\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.webm?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/a13675535fc9f6c504a3993b7e37faea.mp4?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in the fascinating universe of <strong>Par\u00e1metro Zero</strong>, a fiction born from an extensive role-playing campaign that has brought to life a world filled with stories, complex characters, and mysteries waiting to be uncovered. As you explore the village, you will solve challenging puzzles and uncover fragments of <i>Risco de la Colina</i>'s hidden history, where echoes of ancient secrets still linger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.poster.avif?t=1753763083\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.webm?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/13f249c9286ba944e782d530087f1922.mp4?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its somber atmosphere, intriguing characters, and carefully crafted setting, <strong>Cal\u00edgine</strong> delivers an experience that blends the nostalgia of traditional graphic adventures with a mature and captivating narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you dare to uncover the secrets hidden in <i>Risco de la Colina</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.poster.avif?t=1753763083\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.webm?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441660/extras/1fefa38d281ade69f1ec0a4beb758a12.mp4?t=1753763083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
